Acoustic guitar samples
=======================

Origin
    Recorded by the University of Iowa Electronic Music Studios.
    http://theremin.music.uiowa.edu/

Obtained from
    nbrosowsky/tonejs-instruments, folder samples/guitar-acoustic
    https://github.com/nbrosowsky/tonejs-instruments
    (project code MIT, samples released under CC-BY 3.0)

Licence
    Creative Commons Attribution 3.0
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

What is shipped here
    The upstream set is sampled chromatically over D2-D5 (37 files, 6.97 MB).
    Only 13 of those files are included here, one every three semitones:

        D2 F2 G#2 B2 D3 F3 G#3 B3 D4 F4 G#4 B4 D5

    Tone.Sampler repitches them to cover the notes in between, which keeps the
    shift under two semitones — the same fidelity criterion used for the piano
    samples, at a comparable download size. The files themselves are byte-for-
    byte identical to the originals; only the selection is reduced.
